    "infrastructure::tddd::rustdoc_crate_adapter::RustdocCrateAdapter": {
      "action": "modify",
      "docs": "Driven adapter and sole construction boundary for captured rustdoc domain values. It accepts the domain's absolute-path-only target value, performs Unix descriptor-relative no-follow trusted-root admission itself, serializes all exports with one 120-second lock, hashes and typed-decodes immutable bytes into CapturedRustdocJson, and returns RustdocSnapshot only after binding the resolved execution identity and captured bytes within the same lock interval. It rejects non-Unix or symlinked roots and never retries or falls back.",
